#: src/reference/reference/plugin.md:194
msgid ""
"This allows plugins to silently, and correctly, extend existing plugins with "
"more features.  It also can help remove the burden of ordering from the "
"user, allowing the plugin authors greater freedom and power when providing "
"feature for their users."
msgstr ""
"これによりプラグインは、既存のプラグインを透過的に、かつ正しく、機能拡張する"
